 "c": [
  {"i":5356,"t":["character","qualities"],"n":"長所と欠点 is taught mainly as a personal weak point; the flaw-in-things use stays as second topic; failing-grade sense is rare at N3"},
  {"i":5361,"t":["movement"],"s":{"3":["arts"]},"n":"Stair or bus step fits home only loosely; dance step is the one sense that needs its own unit"},
  {"i":5362,"t":["communication","numbers","technology"],"n":"でんわばんごうは なんばんですか is a classic N5 numbers drill, so numbers belongs alongside communication"},
  {"i":5382,"t":["body"],"s":{"2":["qualities"],"3":["shopping"],"4":["food"]},"n":"A showpiece or main attraction is not specifically shopping; only the loss-leader sense (目玉商品) is"},
  {"i":5392,"t":["thinking"],"n":"The gift sense (envelope inscription 志) is rare for learners at N3, so it needs no sense entry"},
  {"i":5457,"t":["nature","geography"],"n":"陸 as land opposed to sea (陸と海) is taught in the nature unit first; geography second"}
 ],
 "d": [
  {"i":5351,"keep":[3,4],"n":"Freelance and freelancer (フリーで働く, フリーのカメラマン) are everyday senses that belong in the work unit."},
  {"i":5361,"keep":[],"n":"The dance step is a minor use; at this level ステップ mostly means a step or a stage, which fits movement."},
  {"i":5364,"keep":[2],"n":"Store signs like ご奉仕価格 and 奉仕品 are common, so a shopping unit fits this sense."},
  {"i":5365,"keep":[2],"n":"The boxing or wrestling ring is a common sense and fits sports."},
  {"i":5382,"keep":[3],"n":"目玉商品 is very common in shopping. The centerpiece sense is figurative, and the fried egg sense is really 目玉焼き, not 目玉 alone."},
  {"i":5395,"keep":[2],"n":"Breaking up an organisation or company (組織の解体) is a frequent sense in the news and fits business."},
  {"i":5407,"keep":[2],"n":"Body injury, especially athletes' 故障, is a common sense and fits health."},
  {"i":5422,"keep":[1],"n":"Engine (蒸気機関, 機関車) is a core sense and fits technology."},
  {"i":5427,"keep":[3],"n":"Data sync (同期する) is very common in tech use. The 'same period' sense is mostly business jargon (前年同期) and not taught under time."},
  {"i":5443,"keep":[2],"n":"Appearing on stage or TV (紅白に出場) is a common sense and fits media and arts."},
  {"i":5470,"keep":[2],"n":"Japan-China (日中関係) is a very common sense and fits geography."},
  {"i":5473,"keep":[2],"n":"A university research assistant is a common sense and fits school."},
  {"i":5483,"keep":[3],"n":"The plant clump or root stock (株分け, a counter for plants) is used in gardening. 'Stump' is usually 切り株, so that sense is dropped."},
  {"i":5492,"keep":[3],"n":"中間テスト and 中間報告 are very common, so time and school both fit."},
  {"i":5493,"keep":[3],"n":"Garbage collection (ゴミ収集) is part of everyday life and fits home and city."}
 ]
